{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「風少」陳浚霆近日趁著假期遠赴法國旅遊，豈料不幸遭遇意外！他在行山期間遭不明昆蟲叮咬，引發極度嚴重的過敏反應，病情更一路蔓延至喉嚨與舌頭，導致飲食與說話均出現困難。返港後他已即時被轉介入院接受治療。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"chandrew117_3955721067876117911_2026-08-03.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026uYeArpUqHG1785812622.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chandrew117_3955721067876117911_2026-08-03.jpeg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳浚霆在社交平台發文向大家報平安，並詳細透露病發經過。他表示去到法國行山後，發現身上開始冒出紅疹，隨後病情迅速惡化：「紅疹從手掌延伸到手臂及臉上以致全身，最後更延伸到喉嚨引致條脷紅腫，飲食說話都有困難！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">他在當地緊急求診，隨即被診所轉介至急症室。在等待了大半天驗血報告後，醫生證實他是被昆蟲叮咬後產生的嚴重過敏反應。雖然他到其他城市再次求診，但情況未見顯著改善，整趟行程幾乎都在診所與醫院的病床上度過。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"chandrew117_3955721071063927989_2026-08-03.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026eFxjswRdj81785812622.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chandrew117_3955721071063927989_2026-08-03.jpeg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"chandrew117_3955721067221912490_2026-08-03.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026sbqSI75gil1785812622.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chandrew117_3955721067221912490_2026-08-03.jpeg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-04 上午10.42.49.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZIUTJTMaXU1785812622.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-04 上午10.42.49.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-04 上午10.57.28.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/202623wjPMkRd91785812622.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-04 上午10.57.28.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">剛抵港的陳浚霆隨即尋求本地醫生協助，並即時被轉介入院治療。面對突如其來的病痛，陳浚霆依然保持幽默樂觀的心態，向擔心他的粉絲及好友道歉：「由於整個旅程都在診所病床或醫院渡過，沒有時間買手信，如果大家問我買咗咩手信俾你哋，我的平安歸來就是你的手信，哈哈哈哈！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">最後，他表示醫生叮囑他最快要到 8 月 9 日才能出院與大家見面，但他亦承諾會努力積極配合治療，望早日康復：「我會繼續努力，希望快啲好返見返大家啦！So good to be back in Hong Kong！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T07:19:58.371184+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":539,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}